| **Open-Source Graphics Drivers** | ✅ Panfrost / Panthor | ✅ Lima |
| **Dynamic DTBO Overlay Support** | ✅ U-Boot / UEFI | ✅ U-Boot / UEFI |
| **Direct SPI Flash (`&sfc`) Control** | ✅ Supported | ✅ Supported |
| **`PREEMPT_RT` Determinism** | ✅ Validated | ✅ Validated |

